WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.831
Riley: This is the perfect place for our Pet Lovers Club meeting.

2
00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:16.657
Sarah: I love going to the pet shop.

3
00:00:16.658 --> 00:00:20.626
Chatter: Happy Birthday!

4
00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:25.097
Skyler: Quiet, Chatter. It's no one's birthday.

5
00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:28.336
Ben: Actually it is someone's

6
00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:35.234
birthday. Look at the

7
00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:38.875
sign. Saturday is the pet shop's tenth birthday.

8
00:00:38.876 --> 00:00:42.047
Riley: And they're having a party to celebrate!

9
00:00:42.048 --> 00:00:44.545
Ben: Kids can work together in teams.

10
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:50.046
Each team brings in ten things about birthdays or pets. Riley:

11
00:00:50.047 --> 00:00:53.072
And everyone gets a prize! The

12
00:00:53.073 --> 00:00:56.291
Pet Lovers Club can do it together! Kids:

13
00:00:56.292 --> 00:01:04.584
Great idea, Riley! Sarah:

14
00:01:04.585 --> 00:01:08.140
There are five of us so . . .

15
00:01:08.141 --> 00:01:12.639
Ben: If we each bring two things, that makes ten.

16
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:16.682
Theo: My sister Kelli knows how to make frog cupcakes.

17
00:01:16.683 --> 00:01:21.471
I can bring two of those. Sarah:

18
00:01:21.472 --> 00:01:25.904
I can bring two Happy Birthday balloons. Chatter:

19
00:01:25.905 --> 00:01:29.435
Ha-ha-ha. Happy Birthday! Skyler:

20
00:01:29.436 --> 00:01:32.501
Stop showing off, Chatter. Ben:

21
00:01:32.502 --> 00:01:38.134
I have socks with turtles on them. Skyler:

22
00:01:38.135 --> 00:01:41.641
I can bring two pots of flowers.

23
00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:45.271
Theo: What do flowers have to do with pets?

24
00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:48.134
Skyler: At the pet shop I saw a sign.

25
00:01:48.135 --> 00:01:54.912
It says, "We Help Kids Bloom into Pet Lovers." Theo:

26
00:01:54.913 --> 00:02:00.092
Oh, I get it now. Riley:

27
00:02:00.093 --> 00:02:02.480
I don't know what to bring. Theo:

28
00:02:02.481 --> 00:02:05.399
You could bring Snooks. Snooks:

29
00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:09.597
Ar-ooo! Skyler:

30
00:02:09.598 --> 00:02:12.140
But you have only one dog. We

31
00:02:12.141 --> 00:02:16.627
each need to bring two things.

32
00:02:16.628 --> 00:02:24.716
Riley: I know! I'll bring my two guppies, Goldie and Goofy!

33
00:02:24.717 --> 00:02:27.759
Theo: I can't wait until Saturday!

34
00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:39.896
The pet shop party is going to be fun!

